              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 13.8–14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.15.1+1SA.15.2+1SA.15.3+1SA.15.4+1SA.15.5+1SA.15.6+1SA.15.7+1SA.15.8+1SA.15.9+1SA.15.10+1SA.15.11+1SA.15.12+1SA.15.13+1SA.15.14+1SA.15.15+1SA.15.16+1SA.15.17+1SA.15.18+1SA.15.19+1SA.15.20+1SA.15.21+1SA.15.22+1SA.15.23+1SA.15.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "15.1–24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.28.7+1SA.28.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "28.7–8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saul died because he was unfaithful to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". He disobeyed the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s commands; he tried to find guidance by consulting the spirits of the dead ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "instead of consulting the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". So the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " killed him and gave control of the kingdom to David son of Jesse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
